# loombox web PWA PREVIEW - Caddy site block for prodbox's
# /etc/caddy/Caddyfile. Same shape as the `app.loombox.dev` block
# `deploy/web/README.md` documents inline for production (that file has no
# separate Caddyfile.snippet of its own) - a different host and a
# different loopback port so the two can never cross. Broken out into its
# own file here rather than inline in a README, matching the
# `deploy/relay-preview/Caddyfile.snippet` convention #864 already
# established for this preview environment.
#
# Requires: DNS A record preview.loombox.dev -> prodbox public IP
# (152.53.44.195, same as its siblings), DNS-only / grey cloud so Caddy,
# not Cloudflare, manages the cert, and 80/443 already open (UFW) - both
# already true on this box for the other *.loombox.dev records.

preview.loombox.dev {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:5188
}
